{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_title", "source_sha256": "b5f787b39e2292af1b91588ad0cb99c261df3efae63c41efac36c0b205329e1a", "ja": "百万の星々", "zh": "百万繁星", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bc62dc7c6a28e08661158a564a45ec3f6ada6d67c4f44c27d5a16fbbc615186c", "ja": "大規模ライブ『アイフェス』の宣伝のため、\n自分達で映像を撮る事になったアイドル達。\nテーマは『私たちの劇場』。ライブまでの\n劇場の何気ない日々を、カメラは活き活き\nと切り取っていく……。", "zh": "为了宣传大规模演唱会“偶像音乐节”，\n偶像们决定亲自拍摄宣传视频。\n主题是“我们的剧场”。直到演出前的\n剧场日常点滴，都被摄像机生动地\n捕捉了下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1000_audience", "source_sha256": "91e71a08f4170b026a6373987ee342928506dea71caec5d660bff967c0c10f3f", "ja": "ワアアアァァァー！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "073a8ead0531183068b8295f592c971d591cfa99e62b36f6365386b93a64e84f", "ja": "このみ姉さん、お疲れさま！\nステージ、すっごく盛り上がったわね♪", "zh": "好累啊，这次辛苦了！\n舞台现场气氛超热烈呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "f722444ed23003565abd020ca4a44fe45aa587e5eadd3e449bd01e309e91d0fc", "ja": "ええ！　私のアダルティと莉緒ちゃんのセクシー、\n余すところなく発揮できたわね！", "zh": "是呀！我的成熟魅力和莉绪的性感，都毫无保留地展现出来了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "1f414f1509bb00d49628163887b64faa3d0e9fece95edf75b712d2a34c213d6f", "ja": "ホント、昨日一緒にエステで仕上げた甲斐が\nあったわ～。ね、歌織ちゃんもそう思うでしょ？", "zh": "真的，昨天一起去美容院做护理也算没白费呢～。对吧，歌织，你也这么觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "1f22d1e882ca81b4df536b86b6886b2fb74e43700a85ee3daff68d776e947d50", "ja": "うふふ、そうね！\nふたりとも、すごく魅力的だったと思うわ。", "zh": "呵呵，是呀！\n我觉得两个人，都非常有魅力哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "7397c92801a38da5432b8ba2c80f4fd7ef65a152649864859e9262f51f3fc2cc", "ja": "歌織ちゃんだって、今日は一段とエレガントだった\nじゃない。お姉さん、ぐっときちゃった♪", "zh": "歌织今天也格外优雅，不是吗。姐姐我一下子就被打动了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "de13c37e0ffa415cf3c40e2ac59b0bf690ec6ec764ce06d30200159d99bc6380", "ja": "もう……。あ、私のことはともかく、えっと……\nはい、おふたりの感想をお願いします♪", "zh": "真是的……啊，先不说我了，那个……\n好啦，请两位谈谈感想吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "9c1430ada323ccddf924641db3d289fac504be945105184c8426a80f6e3b85cd", "ja": "感想かぁ……今日は、みんなすごかったわよね。\nパフォーマンスの完成度もそうだし、勢いもあって。", "zh": "感想啊……今天大家都很厉害呢。\n不管是表演的完成度，还是气势，都很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "d1292b382e123cbff269284de0ba65e58cbbdcec9333186aeaee1347b8443869", "ja": "勢いは本当にそうね。私たちも大人組として、\n若い子達に負けてられないわよ！", "zh": "势头确实很足呢。我们作为成年组，也不能输给年轻孩子们呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "0d6a2d83c4dc16342cf022feb3e88a11858859a8287e4ffeab4feff5db52b901", "ja": "でも～お肌じゃ勝てないし～。……あ、それじゃあ、\nこのあと作戦会議しない？　風花ちゃん達も誘って♪", "zh": "不过论皮肤我们可赢不了～……啊，那接下来要不要开个作战会议？也邀请风花她们一起♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "6f684c2e7e6ede77d3382845ac6c3c686d79e311ac720813390282083711c8a0", "ja": "賛成！　フフフ、アダルティの魅力を、これから\nどう磨き上げていくか……朝まで話し合いましょう♪", "zh": "赞成！呵呵呵，今后该如何进一步打磨成熟女性的魅力……我们就讨论到早上吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "b63b6e70ad1d888101eb204c5855096c39ad47bb4869c62d527f3298ddef8c4b", "ja": "決まり！　昨日ちょうどいいお店見つけたんだ～♪\nほら歌織ちゃんも準備して。早く早くっ！", "zh": "就这么定了！昨天我正好找到一家合适的店～♪\n歌织也准备一下。快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1013_p", "source_sha256": "dc266ed589fdd3e3198a1cdf3cd109e827e018b449492747ac9e5f79d2f1c1c9", "ja": "（劇場のみんなのステージが終わり、次は春香達の\n出番。……よし、ここはひとつ、俺が……）", "zh": "（剧场里大家的演出结束了，接下来轮到春香她们上场。……好，这里就由我来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "fc41991e5f7adfa96b467e5794313593925450ad00e6a570831dbb9eb135ea13", "ja": "あーっ、兄ちゃんがカメラ回してる～！", "zh": "啊～，大哥在拍视频耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "9281a848ef180ae00dd980945a16142ecda1f67bcca871f543ee915d2cf78e75", "ja": "ホントだ～！　はい、カメラはこっちこっち！\nあっは～ん♪", "zh": "真的耶～！来，镜头往这边，这边！\n啊哈～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1016_p", "source_sha256": "35ecab53368f537624fe402babd5e2919d29b42667c035327e48bf274e31fa7e", "ja": "いや、そういうのは……。むしろなるべく、\n自然に頼むよ。おーいみんな、準備はどうだ？", "zh": "不是，我不是说那个……。总之，尽量自然一点吧。喂——大家，准备得怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "fac2004676d45a575ef035adf0e1a45649a4229a3f50110a6f256768eb017075", "ja": "バッチリですよ！　何しろ劇場のみんなのステージが\nすごくて、ボクは今、めちゃくちゃ燃えてますからね！", "zh": "准备得妥妥的！毕竟剧场里大家的舞台实在太精彩了，我现在可是燃到不行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "e8964db52d12379da9746e6232b87977ea1f2d6c85a2f401a3d964f08b102960", "ja": "ふふっ、今さらですけど、\nみんなすっかり、立派なアイドルですよね♪", "zh": "呵呵，虽然现在才这么说，不过大家都已经成为很出色的偶像了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4dc26bc16683390ba2a46c51814a975f0ee72276678377c66f1b0a290221670a", "ja": "今日だって、こんなに客席を盛り上げて……\nすごいなぁ～♪", "zh": "今天也把观众席炒得这么热闹……\n真厉害呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "fbd1f1224c082fbab0e850eb5fe1a1765d4bf5a5fc7cb6f5a122b069bea0ec97", "ja": "ま、私がそこそこアイドルやれてるわけですから。\nあの子達ができないわけないんですけどね。", "zh": "嘛，既然我也还算是个像样的偶像，她们就不可能做不到吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "e3aa13eb805f76dfb6b51eac86b7ab2fb67a38882189722501b650b5e0626e69", "ja": "私達もきっと、みんなと一緒に劇場で過ごすように\nなって、たくさん成長できたんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "我们一定也是因为和大家一起在剧场度过时光，才得以成长了许多吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "7aeac8c0cbfa3fe284744ddeafe3129da293e3464114810de0afbd08d3f8a27b", "ja": "そうですね。みんなが来てくれるから、ボク達も\nもっと前に進まなきゃ！なんて思っちゃいますし。", "zh": "是啊。因为大家愿意来到剧场，我们也会忍不住觉得，必须继续向前迈进才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "965eab444a7bf818d112ef55224a6325afadf5b7cdfbc4968cfbe1fa2552e57f", "ja": "今日はみんなが繋いでくれたバトンを、\n私達がしっかり、受け取らなくちゃですね！", "zh": "今天，我们也要好好接过大家为我们传下来的接力棒才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "d2d05cf5f867bda31acfd1a3b4d7e4184dce4109ce596e5994153b9cf2f0910c", "ja": "うんうん！　でもって真美はそのバトンを、\n亜美に託すよ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！然后真美要把那根接力棒，托付给亚美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1025_011ami", "source_sha256": "18f53a38b7a2c437e66ab14250f99f64e661c22104918cf4f6c66d4f0d7a60c8", "ja": "うんうん！　でもって亜美はそのバトンを、\n兄ちゃんに託すよ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！然后，亜美要把这根接力棒，\n交给哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "22912b2c7431fb2adf54b4c17c90eff2e3c813bd407683f08de37d31381f4a3c", "ja": "託さなくていいのっ。私達は、バトンをしっかり持って\nゴールまで駆け抜けるだけ！　さ、行くわよみんな！", "zh": "不用托付给别人。我们只需要紧紧握住接力棒，一口气冲到终点！好了，大家出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1027_011ami", "source_sha256": "12cd78ed6982455c387e60dafc61661ee6f9ee3da8d94fe1a5611a6ac3d29121", "ja": "ラジャー了解！", "zh": "收到了解！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "12cd78ed6982455c387e60dafc61661ee6f9ee3da8d94fe1a5611a6ac3d29121", "ja": "ラジャー了解！", "zh": "收到了解！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1029_p", "source_sha256": "13f39cf29665c9ba8794b663262f4866eb2c3cb2c6ceadb7bf74a9e85d03bc71", "ja": "（劇場ができてから、変わったものも、\n変わらなかったものもある……）", "zh": "（剧场建成以来，有些东西变了，也有些东西没有改变……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_077_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_077_1030_p", "source_sha256": "2d8658b6fd62b56916dfd1168eaafa32d8d3d78c8dfc272df54bcb307e2df64b", "ja": "（これからもそうやって、続いていくのだろう。\nかけがえのない時間を、積み重ねながら……）", "zh": "（今后也会像这样继续下去吧。一点一点积累起这段无可替代的时光……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
